# p2p-kids-admin — LOCAL-ONLY secrets template
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the real values:
#
#     cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# `.env.local` is listed in `.gitignore` and MUST NEVER be committed.
# If it ever shows up in `git status`, stop and fix that before continuing.
#
# App/runtime keys (Supabase URL + anon key, service role key, Stripe, Sentry)
# are documented in `.env.example`. This file only documents the extra
# local-only secrets that must never land in a doc, code, or a log line.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Staging admin login — manual browser verification of the admin portal
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used by humans/agents to sign in at http://localhost:3001/auth/login against
# the staging Supabase project.
# Referenced by `.github/copilot-instructions.md` > "Admin portal login".
ADMIN_STAGING_EMAIL=replace-with-staging-admin-email@example.com
ADMIN_STAGING_PASSWORD=replace-with-staging-admin-password
